Package: zurngtest
Title: Test Random Number Generators with 'PractRand'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Chris", "Doty-Humphrey", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "PractRand library, src/practrand/")
  )
Description: Runs the 'PractRand' statistical test suite for random number
    generators by Chris Doty-Humphrey from R. Bits from a generator are
    tested at doubling lengths, and the result reports the length at which
    the generator first fails. Bits can come from R's own generators, from
    an R function, from raw bytes or a connection, or from a C function
    registered by another package, which is the fast path for generator
    packages.
